# ============================================================
# Raushan Kumar Pathak — Portfolio
# ============================================================
# No environment variables are required to build or deploy this
# project (static GitHub Pages site — there is no server).
#
# The contact form sends email directly from the visitor's browser:
#   1) FormSubmit (no key needed)
#   2) Web3Forms  (backup) — the access key is public by design
#      and embedded in src/components/portfolio/contact.tsx.
#      Optionally override it here:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
